# photo-tool core

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [docs/README.md](../../docs/README.md) before large changes.

## Module layout

- Entry: `main.go` (GUI) / `internal/cli` (CLI) — CLI must not import Fyne
- `internal/ingest` — single dedup path for upload, scan, import
- `internal/store` — SQLite only; no SQL in `internal/app`
- `internal/share` + `web/share` — loopback HTTP share pages

## MUST rules

- One `OperationSummary` for GUI and CLI (`internal/domain/summary.go`)
- Hash-only share tokens in DB — never store raw tokens
- Default queries exclude rejected and deleted assets
- Share HTML must not emit raw GPS

## Before submitting

```bash
make test    # minimum
make gate    # before large or cross-package changes
```

Never add LLM/agent steps to CI.
